1️⃣ Add Two Numbers — LeetCode #2 ⭐⭐⭐
class Solution {
    public ListNode addTwoNumbers(ListNode l1, ListNode l2) {

        ListNode dummy = new ListNode(0);
        ListNode current = dummy;

        int carry = 0;

        while (l1 != null || l2 != null || carry != 0) {

            int sum = carry;

            if (l1 != null) {
                sum += l1.val;
                l1 = l1.next;
            }

            if (l2 != null) {
                sum += l2.val;
                l2 = l2.next;
            }

            carry = sum / 10;

            current.next = new ListNode(sum % 10);
            current = current.next;
        }

        return dummy.next;
    }
}

Example:

l1 = 2 → 4 → 3
l2 = 5 → 6 → 4

Output = 7 → 0 → 8
2️⃣ Intersection of Two Linked Lists — LeetCode #160 ⭐⭐⭐
public class Solution {
    public ListNode getIntersectionNode(
        ListNode headA,
        ListNode headB
    ) {

        ListNode a = headA;
        ListNode b = headB;

        while (a != b) {

            a = (a == null) ? headB : a.next;
            b = (b == null) ? headA : b.next;
        }

        return a;
    }
}
🧠 Trick
A → A's path → B's path
B → B's path → A's path

Both pointers travel same total distance, so intersection irundha same node-la meet aagum.

Time: O(n + m)
Space: O(1) ✅

3️⃣ Reorder List — LeetCode #143 ⭐⭐⭐
class Solution {
    public void reorderList(ListNode head) {

        if (head == null || head.next == null) {
            return;
        }

        // Find middle
        ListNode slow = head;
        ListNode fast = head;

        while (fast != null && fast.next != null) {
            slow = slow.next;
            fast = fast.next.next;
        }

        // Reverse second half
        ListNode second = slow.next;
        slow.next = null;

        ListNode prev = null;

        while (second != null) {
            ListNode next = second.next;
            second.next = prev;
            prev = second;
            second = next;
        }

        // Merge two halves
        ListNode first = head;
        second = prev;

        while (second != null) {

            ListNode firstNext = first.next;
            ListNode secondNext = second.next;

            first.next = second;
            second.next = firstNext;

            first = firstNext;
            second = secondNext;
        }
    }
}

